  "adaptation": {
    "semantic": null,
    "grammar": "\"kind of\" is usually followed by a noun with no article in careful writing (*this kind of tree*); a plural needs **kinds** (*all kinds of things*).",
    "culture": null,
    "false_friends": "In some languages a word spelled **kind** means *child*; the English noun **kind** means *type*.",
